<div id="toc"><h1 id="toc-title">UNTITLED</h1><ol class="toc"><li id="toc-li-1"><a href="text/ch001.xhtml#section">UNTITLED</a></li></ol></div>
<!-- EPUB/text/ch001.xhtml -->
<div id="section" class="section level1 unnumbered">
<h1 class="unnumbered"></h1>
<p>A <a href="https://example.com"> linked body </a> keeps the padding of its content.</p>
<p>A box holds <span class="box"> its own spacing </span> within the line.</p>
<p>An underlined <span style="text-decoration: underline"> padded body </span> sits beside plain words.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>A spaced quotation.</p>
<p>—  A. Author </p>
</blockquote>
<p>A footnote body is trimmed <a href="#fn1" class="footnote-ref" id="fnref1">1</a> here.</p>
<div class="float">
<p><span></span></p>
<div class="figcaption"><p>Figure caption.</p></div>
</div>
<p>Loop rounds join with their padding: 1 2 3 .</p>
<p>A measurement of 6.0em, a ratio of 50%, and 1.5e-2 exact.</p>
<p><span></span></p>
<p>The binding kept survives its statement.</p>
</div>
<div class="footnotes footnotes-end-of-document">
<hr />
<div id="fn1">
<p><a href="#fnref1" class="footnote-back">1</a>. Trimmed on both ends.</p>
</div>
</div>
